{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00408","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 寿和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 寿和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇崇泰畤，肃肃严禋。\n粢盛既洁，金石毕陈。\n上帝来享，介福爰臻。\n受厘合祉，宝祚维新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}